WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:04.190
We believe King is targeting
the girl for some reason.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.610
We know it'll be difficult to fight
Knight or King while protecting her.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.940
We will be dispatching
Makai Alchemists as well.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.650
Please meet up with them in San Dell Diós.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.200
I should have listened better.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.050
I should have talked more.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.040
Why do you continue to fight, Sword?

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.650
It's a path I chose.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.540
Let's go.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:29.800
Yeah!

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:32.880
Mom!

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:37.800
Luke.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:42.570
True strength isn't something
you obtain for yourself.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.460
It's something you obtain for others.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:58.040
He's a serial kidnapper and killer.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.490
On top of that, he always targets children.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:05.000
So, what about him?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.560
He escaped the city five days ago on bike.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Two days ago,
he was sighted by highway patrol

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.530
at the 1500 km marker west
of the city on route 69.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.840
We chased him, but...

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:19.110
He got away.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:23.450
The shoot-out ended with one officer dead

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.100
and another in critical condition.

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.600
The culprit headed
further west on route 69.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:30.060
In other words, he's coming our way.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:36.740
Yeah. There's a good chance
he'll pass through town.

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:40.950
On top of that, he currently
has a kidnapped girl with him.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:41.950
What?!

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.370
We'll save the girl if it comes down to it.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.570
Right.

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:55.630
This town never forgives criminals.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:23.080
<i>The monochromatic empty eyes</i>
<i>of</i> <i>sapiens</i> <i>floating</i> <i>within the unreality</i>

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:28.460
<i>Completely peerless flowing</i> <i>blood,</i>
<i>controlled</i> <i>and digitized</i>

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.120
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.540
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:32.710
<i>Can you see?</i>

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.880
<i>(BOOING BOOING) Hellacious</i>

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.260
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.920
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:38.970
<i>I can see!</i>

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.970
<i>The timing of the programming</i>

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:41.840
<i>Yea, gotcha!</i>

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.560
<i>I want to be eroded away (brain wash)</i>

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.730
<i>Up the blast! </i>

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:51.770
<i>Ah, this dying world </i>

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:58.280
<i>Run like you're piercing through it</i>

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:04.620
<i>The rising flames burn everything away </i>

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:09.290
<i>Your resolve and your love</i>

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.880
<i>From darkness to the light</i>

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:44.030
San Dell Diós. So this is the place?

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.960
I've seen towns like this in movies before.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:07.600
He's here, Natalia. Where is Alfil?

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:10.020
He should be patrolling
the outskirts of town.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.180
No word from him.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.140
What should we do?

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.400
It's all right. Please 
go ahead with the plan.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:21.240
I'm sorry. If I was a little younger,
I'd run over to help.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:24.570
It's fine. I'm depending
on you if the time comes.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:31.140
Well, we'll have to wait until
our escort makes contact with us.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.660
Let's look around town until then.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.080
Huh? Is it okay for us to do that?

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.840
You have to keep things in balance,
no matter what the task.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:42.510
And enjoying everything I do is...

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.380
Your motto!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.180
Exactly right!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.860
You two.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.990
Are you in the middle of traveling?

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.980
Oh, my. What a cute one you are.

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.940
Yes, he'll be here soon.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.530
Shit. At a time like this,
I'm stranded with a flat tire.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.200
Got it. We'll handle things here.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:12.700
You can't, Natalia.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:16.710
It'll be fine. Just get over
here as quick as possible.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:19.130
Don't do anything reckless.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:22.880
Welcome!

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:23.960
Hello.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.760
We were just recommended
by an old lady to come here.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.640
That this was the place to be!

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.800
Aw, that makes me so happy.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.810
What items do you suggest?

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:35.640
Well, let's see...

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:37.690
How is it?

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:40.120
No sign of any Horrors here.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.470
I see.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.820
My respects.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:49.730
Huh?

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:51.830
H-Huh?

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.000
It's a disease he has.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.500
What are you talking about?

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.380
I'm thanking the blessings from heaven.

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.710
Stop it. That's embarrassing.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.930
Just give up being a human.

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.420
No way.

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:08.470
Ma'am.

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:12.180
Can you make something for us 
to eat using local ingredients?

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:15.220
Y-Yes.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.560
That's fine, but no complaints
on what's served to you.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.480
Looks like things are
going smoothly for now.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.440
Shouldn't we eliminate
the Golden Knight here?

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.180
That's not for you to decide.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.250
I just want to finish
things up and hurry home.

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.330
What does King of
El Dorado want that girl for?

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.450
Also none of your business.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.420
Listen, the objective takes top priority.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:44.460
We need to avoid contact
with him as much as possible.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.970
Use the humans that he can't
lay a hand on until the very end.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.310
As you wish.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.850
Hey! Give this table the special!

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:56.560
Okay!

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.810
Our treat.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:00.440
Huh? You sure?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:04.820
Yeah. We don't get the chance
to talk to outsiders too much.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.940
There aren't many that come through here.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:09.900
Then, we'll take you up on that.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.490
Thank you.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:17.660
Is the lack of visitors
because of the lack of safety?

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:20.210
Yes, until recently.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:26.580
The government and the police
abandoned the area west of here.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:33.470
The people from there would come
here to steal, destroy, and murder.

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.650
It was really terrible.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.640
Why did you stay here, after all that?

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:42.850
Yes. After all, this is
the town we were born in.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.110
Here you go! Thanks for waiting!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.900
Stop that!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.280
Don't hold back and eat up!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.000
Enjoy!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.120
You mentioned that was only until recently.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.460
Are things different now?

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:10.880
Yes. We decided to protect ourselves
and this town, ourselves.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:15.890
With everything that happened,
we reached our limit.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.810
But we couldn't depend on the police.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:20.850
So we made our own vigilante group.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:22.600
Vigilante group?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:26.400
We made our own police system together.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.940
This town will not
forgive criminals ever again.

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.610
Someone has to punish them.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:36.820
Wow, Miss Natalia
and the others are amazing!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:37.910
Huh? Y-Yeah.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:41.870
We also have a sheriff named Alfil now.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.580
Alfil?

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.080
Was it two years ago now?

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:49.670
He was so young, but he
worked hard to protect this town.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:54.030
He taught us everything from how
to shoot a gun to the art of self-defense.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.760
He even gave us advice when
we were created our vigilante group.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:01.720
Since then, the crime clearance
rate here has shot up!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.350
So cool! They're like heroes!

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.940
Yeah. That's impressive!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.560
Well, in other words.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:10.190
People don't come by
this town even though it's safe.

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:12.740
Simply because there really
isn't anything to do around here!

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.000
Hey, now!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:21.990
Should we go soon?

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:24.460
Yeah. I'm going to the restroom.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.140
I'll show you where it is.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:27.790
Thanks!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:36.550
Huh?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.220
This way.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.970
Huh? Where are we going?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.560
There's no need to worry anymore.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:46.560
Take care of the rest.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.390
Leave it to me.

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.690
Now, get in.

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.230
Huh? Why?

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.730
Don't worry. Hurry.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.210
Sword!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.830
Hey. Hey. What's the big—

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:12.540
Don't move! We won't let
you do what you want any longer!

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.680
He's gone.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.100
No! Let me go!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.440
Please calm down!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.560
Natalia. Hurry!

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:32.820
Sophie!

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:33.690
Sword!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:34.690
There he is!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.410
Sophie!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.740
It can't be helped. Get in with her.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:49.500
Sophie!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.960
Let me out! Let me out of here!

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:53.290
Listen to me.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:55.170
We're not like that man!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.940
I don't get what you're saying!
Just let me out!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:10:58.750
Sophie!

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.510
We're trying to take you back home!

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:03.890
Huh?

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.560
He's gone.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:06.180
Shit!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.640
You looking properly?!

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.450
Jeez...

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:31.920
Where did he go?!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.300
Th-The hell is this?!

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:42.300
There he is! Don't let
the kidnapper leave town!

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:49.390
Kidnapper? What in the world is going on?

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:55.020
Miss Natalia, you've got it wrong!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:59.070
Sword isn't that kind of person
and I wasn't kidnapped.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:01.530
Sophie...

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.530
Stockholm syndrome.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:06.410
Huh? What's that?

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:10.250
In some kidnappings or hostage situations

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.540
the victim feels like the criminal is
an ally after spending time with them.

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:14.830
Huh?

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.670
So that's why you seemed
so close with him!

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.630
I'm telling you that you're wrong!

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.430
Stop! That's dangerous!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.850
Let me go! Stop this car!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.890
I don't have whatever-syndrome!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.240
Calm down!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.650
Natalia, sedate her.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:38.280
But...

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:42.320
She won't listen until
we calm her down once.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.330
Hand it over.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.830
Wait, Miss Natalia!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.240
Hey, stop.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:57.540
No! Stop! Noo! Stop it!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:02.970
Hey, Sophie!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:06.180
That's dangerous. Let go!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:15.350
Hey! I haven't done anything!

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:23.440
Huh?

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.330
Are you just planning
to run the whole time?!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.960
They're humans. It can't be helped!

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.180
Old lady! It's dangerous
so get back inside the house!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.020
Are you freaking kidding me?!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.900
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.700
Dammit. Hang in there, Sophie!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:11.580
Do you really have time
to worry about others?

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:12.790
Shut up!

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.240
They're really not Horrors, right?

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:39.890
Definitely humans.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.970
This barrier.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.000
No way?! Huh?!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.800
You look good.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.470
Sword.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:18.100
Gina!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.350
Why are you here?

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.980
What do you mean?

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:24.480
I was told to escort you two
and what do I find when I get here?

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:35.330
You're in a mess like this.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.040
Just what did you do?

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.380
No idea.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:46.050
We won't hurt you! Please believe me!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.710
You're wrong, Miss Natalia.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.970
That man is lying to you.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:54.220
I told you! This person helped our town!

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:55.990
Then, let me confirm.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:58.750
What do you plan to do?

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.230
I'm not going to do anything.

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:04.980
I'm just going to wait for Sword.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.650
Sophie, that man is already...

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.570
He'll come!

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.480
Sword will definitely come!

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:17.330
Alfil, something is wrong.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:21.040
Sophie doesn't look
like she's lost her mind.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:22.710
Alfil?

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.420
Looks like this is as far as we can go.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.170
We can't deceive them any further.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.010
I'm sorry.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:38.310
Wh-What? What's going on?

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.080
What shall I do?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:44.900
The situation has changed.
I don't care if you're a little rough.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.310
I knew he was a Horror!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:52.530
Alfil!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:54.840
Miss Natalia!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:56.820
Don't come any closer!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.330
I won't hurt you as long as you don't resist.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:04.790
My master, the King of
El Dorado, summons you.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:09.550
Step back! I'll kill
myself if you do anything!

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:13.300
So that's how you want to play it.

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:16.700
What a fierce little thing she is.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:28.060
Sophie! Sophie!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.270
Are you okay?!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:31.380
Get a hold of yourself, Sophie!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.220
Sophie!

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.240
Sorry about that.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.700
You had such a scary experience.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.160
It's okay now.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.130
Sword!

00:17:58.760 --> 00:17:59.850
Golden Knight.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:02.140
Take care of Miss Natalia.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:02.990
Yeah.

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:05.770
As I thought.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:09.610
I should have eliminated
you from the beginning.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:27.000
No good. You're definitely dead.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.690
Miss Natalia!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:40.800
Sophie.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:47.690
Wh-What is that?!

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:50.600
It's okay. Just leave everything to Sword!

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.130
Zaruba!

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:07.510
As expected of the Golden Knight.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:14.210
Nice to meet you. I am Bishop.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:19.720
Will you come with me to my master,
King of El Dorado, princess?

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:34.060
Gina!

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:50.120
That town was a
pretty good feeding ground.

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.580
Feeding ground?

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:57.000
I see. That sheriff was already
a Horror when he came to town.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:20:00.340
It seems he's different from
the regular small fry we deal with.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:33.420
Sorry. I don't plan on
fighting with you directly.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:37.790
Hurry up and die, Golden Knight.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:49.980
The town is gone...

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:56.270
That bastard even used the town itself.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:59.900
Yes. I did as you asked.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:02.570
As long as the people are safe,
they'll be able to rebuild.

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:03.900
Safe?

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.030
What do you mean?

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:12.120
I locked them all up because
he said it'd be trouble if they chased us.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:24.590
I wonder if they'll all believe Natalia.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:28.140
They're such a cohesive group.
You shouldn't be worried.

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:29.470
You're right.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:33.520
Even so, another troublesome
one popped up this time.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:36.440
He called himself Bishop.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:39.020
Bishop, huh?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:43.240
It's okay. Gina is here, too.

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:51.660
I guess I'll need to live up
to those expectations.

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:56.420
Let's go.

00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:59.960
Well, you did well this time.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:03.560
Yeah!

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:41.630
<i>When I close my eyes I feel</i>
<i>gentle</i> <i>arms</i> <i>around</i> <i>me</i>

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:46.090
<i>Warmth and memory</i>

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:50.470
<i>SIGHT I can feel it now</i>

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:54.770
<i>Without even saying goodbye</i>

00:22:54.770 --> 00:23:03.360
<i>We've chosen different</i> <i>paths</i>
<i>without</i> <i>realizing</i> <i>it</i>

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>Forced forward at the mercy of fate</i>

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:12.910
<i>When I'm sad</i>

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:28.840
<i>I keep thinking of your</i>
<i>sweet</i> <i>smile</i> <i>as</i> <i>I</i> <i>look</i> <i>up</i> <i>at the sky</i>

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:33.390
<i>I want to protect you</i>

00:23:33.390 --> 00:23:41.600
<i>I will become strong and keep walking </i>

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:48.820
<i>That's how I will live for another</i>
